<title>LATVIA: LATVIA-TWO-YEAR YIELD 9.52 PCT AT T-BILL AUCTION.</title>
<headline>LATVIA-TWO-YEAR YIELD 9.52 PCT AT T-BILL AUCTION.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yield of two-year</p>
<p>Latvian T-bills was 9.52 percent at auction on Wednesday, the</p>
<p>state exchequer said.</p>
<p>The two-year paper was being auctioned for the first time on</p>
<p>Wednesday.</p>
<p>Among shorter-term maturities, one-month yields rose while</p>
<p>three-month paper slipped, it added.</p>
<p>All amounts are in millions of lats.</p>
<p> MATURITY    AV YLD(pct) LAST WEEK NO OF BNKS ISSUE  BID  SOLD</p>
<p> One-month    5.42	   4.49	  2	0.50   0.75 0.50</p>
<p> Three-month  5.74	   5.86	  7	 1.0   2.14  1.0</p>
<p> Two-year     9.52	   --	   12	17.0  48.32 17.0</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
